[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582917915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2582917915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2582917915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9DMb","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:07:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:10:55Z","body":"Not sure about this one, it's identical to `clear` and is only present in three other types, `LocalVector`, `AHashMap` and `HashMap`, and only the first is really relevant for that, so I don't think there's much syncing up with other containers here\r\n\r\nI don't see the *usefulness* of this, which should be the guiding principle behind new features","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582917915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582921747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2582921747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2582921747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9EIT","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:08:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:08:57Z","body":"> Not sure about this one, it's identical to `clear` and is only present in two other types, `LocalVector` and `HashMap`, and only the former is really relevant for that, so I don't think there's much syncing up with other containers here\r\n> \r\n> I don't see the _usefulness_ of this, which should be the guiding principle behind new features\r\n\r\nFor me this is about API consistency, which is key to reducing complexity in large codebases. imo, it was incorrect to call the function `clear` in the first place. Ideally, this would be amended in the future.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582921747/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582925406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2582925406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2582925406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9FBe","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:10:38Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:13:31Z","body":"But this doesn't add consistency, it adds something that's present in three out of 15 or more classes to three more, that's *reducing* consistency\r\n\r\nIf it did something unique I'd say it would make sense, but now it just creates an alias for `clear` which is just confusing","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582925406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582971709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2582971709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2582971709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9QU9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:32:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:33:31Z","body":"> But this doesn't add consistency, it adds something that's present in three out of 15 or more classes to three more, that's _reducing_ consistency\r\n> \r\n> If it did something unique I'd say it would make sense, but now it just creates an alias for `clear` which is just confusing\r\n\r\n😄 you got a point there!\r\nI did expect more containers to offer `reset` so I'm somewhat surprised this is not the case.\r\n\r\nThe reason I chose `reset` for this function is that, whenever collections have both, `clear` means \"destruct objects but not buffer\", but `reset` means \"also destruct buffer\". This is also consistent with STL's concept of `clear`.\r\nIn that sense, I'd view renaming `clear` to `reset` in all other cases as the best choice. But that's _very_ large task, and the similar discussion about `ptr()` isn't even through yet (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100555), so I wanted to see if people _generally_ agree we should attempt to work towards consistency in this way.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582971709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582997515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2582997515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2582997515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9WoL","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:44:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:46:54Z","body":"I'd say consistency in this case means \"a class has the function if it actually needs it\", not \"slap the function on anything\".\r\n\r\nAlso this method should either be bound on `String` or not added to `String`, otherwise it adds an annoying additional thing to keep an eye out for when dealing with extensions and modules etc. because `String` is a bound class (it would have to be added to godot-cpp as well) and should also be added to `Packed*Array` binds for the same reason\r\n\r\nThe exact same concept applies to `ptr/ptrw` IMO","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582997515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583037573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2583037573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2583037573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9gaF","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:55:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T19:34:19Z","body":"> Also this method should either be bound on `String` or not added to `String`\r\n\r\nYeah, that's probably true! Valid reason to stall considering this PR until `clear` can actually be implemented differently (and even then we'll have future API compatibility concerns...).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583037573/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583110989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2583110989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2583110989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9yVN","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T16:11:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T16:11:33Z","body":"Agreed, I think adding a `reset` before it actually is functionally different will either:\r\n* Never be used as it doesn't make any difference, or,\r\n* Will be used inconsistently and will make changing it to actually have distinct functionality a mess","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583110989/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583722142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101393#issuecomment-2583722142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101393","id":2583722142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aAHie","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T19:23:44Z","updat